# Names in the runtime's install/omarchy-other.packages that only an aarch64
# machine has, so no x86_64 build carries them: the x86_64 build leaves each one
# out of its offline mirror and out of its install set. Every one of these is
# installed by the hardware setup of the model that needs it, not by a default
# install set.
asus-proart-p14-audio
asus-proart-pz13-audio
asus-zenbook-a16-audio
asus-zenbook-a16-firmware
asus-zenbook-14-ux3480qa-audio
iptsd
microsoft-surface-laptop-8-support
microsoft-surface-pro-11-sensors
microsoft-surface-pro-11-support

# The same packages under the names omarchy-pkgs used before it renamed them.
# A stable image reads these lists from the stable omarchy package, which names
# them this way until it is released with the new names.
asus-proart-p14-speaker-firmware
surface-laptop-8-support
surface-pro-11-sensors
surface-pro-11-support
